### LearnSprint - Increment 1 requests
### With the sample data: admin is user 1, faculty are users 2 and 3, students are users 4 to 9.
### Copy each request into Postman, or run this file in IntelliJ Ultimate / VS Code REST Client.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### READ all students
GET {{host}}/api/students

### READ one student
GET {{host}}/api/students/4

### CREATE a student
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fname": "Maria Clara",
  "lname": "Ibarra",
  "email": "maria.ibarra@cit.edu",
  "password": "student123",
  "schoolId": "24-0009-999",
  "program": "BS Computer Science",
  "yearLevel": 1
}

### UPDATE a student (leave out "password" to keep the current one)
PUT {{host}}/api/students/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fname": "Johnmark",
  "lname": "Tanaleon",
  "email": "johnmark.tanaleon@cit.edu",
  "schoolId": "22-0001-101",
  "program": "BS Information Technology",
  "yearLevel": 4,
  "totalPoints": 360,
  "currentStreak": 6
}

### CREATE a course taught by faculty 2
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "IT365",
  "title": "Data Analytics 1",
  "description": "Introduction to analytics tooling.",
  "faculty": { "userId": 2 }
}

### CREATE a track inside course 1
POST {{host}}/api/tracks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Testing the API",
  "sequenceNo": 3,
  "course": { "courseId": 1 }
}

### CREATE lesson progress done offline, still waiting to sync
POST {{host}}/api/lesson-progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "dateCompleted": "2026-11-11",
  "isSynced": false,
  "student": { "userId": 5 },
  "lesson": { "lessonId": 3 }
}

### 400 - a required value is missing
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No code and no faculty"
}

### 404 - the id does not exist
GET {{host}}/api/courses/999

### 409 - course 1 still has tracks, so the database refuses the delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/courses/1

### DELETE - the track created above (use the id from its response)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tracks/4

### Row counts of every table
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
